# FightHub — Python requirements
# Install with: pip install -r requirements
#
# Versions are PINNED, not floored. Every line here used to be `>=`, which
# meant `docker build` resolved whatever was newest that day: two builds of the
# same commit could ship different dependency trees, a broken upstream release
# arrived without anything changing in this repository, and a compromised one
# would have arrived the same way.
#
# To update a pin deliberately:
#   pip install -U <package> && pip freeze | grep -i <package>
# then change the line here and test. Check the changelog first for anything
# in the security block.

